# Example requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client).
# Get a token first:  make token USER_NAME=supervisor PASS=supervisor-demo
@api = http://localhost:8000
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Ticket detail
GET {{api}}/api/v1/tickets/T-101
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start a one-ticket investigation
POST {{api}}/api/v1/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "ticket", "ticket_number": "T-101", "instruction": "Investigate delivery delay and prepare a refund and customer reply if justified."}

### Start a batch (max 10)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mode": "batch", "instruction": "Review delayed deliveries and prepare resolutions.", "filters": {"priority": "high", "status": "open"}, "limit": 10}

### Run status, findings and proposals
GET {{api}}/api/v1/runs/{{run_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Event stream (SSE). Add Last-Event-ID to resume after a given event.
GET {{api}}/api/v1/runs/{{run_id}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Last-Event-ID: 0

### Pending approvals (supervisor+)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/approvals?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve (repeat it: same 200 response, no second effect)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/approvals/{{approval_id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "approve", "note": "Verified the delay and policy"}

### Simulated ledger
GET {{api}}/api/v1/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit (admin)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/audit-events?limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
